  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installation of gnome-text-editor</title>

    <para>
      Install <application>gnome-text-editor</application> by running the following
      commands:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup ..            \
      --prefix=/usr       \
      --buildtype=release &amp;&amp;

ninja</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      To test the results, run: <command>ninja test</command>,
    </para>

    <para>
      Now, as the &root; user:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>
